# Raven88 Audiobooks

A Kodi addon that turns written stories into audiobooks using cloud text-to-speech.

## Features
- 16 built-in stories — tap one in the addon to start listening
- Stories play as a full audiobook playlist, chunk by chunk
- Raven-themed icon and flying-raven background

## Installation (Kodi 21 "Omega")
1. Download the addon zip: [plugin.audio.ravenbooks-0.1.2.zip](https://github.com/trev851/https-raven88.github.io/raw/main/plugin.audio.ravenbooks-0.1.2.zip)
2. In Kodi, go to **Settings > Add-ons > Install from zip file**
3. Select the downloaded zip
4. Once installed, open **Add-ons > Audio add-ons > Raven88 Audiobooks**
5. Tap any story to start listening

## Version
Current: v0.1.4
